sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Script
    participant Mat as Material
    participant Shaft as ShaftElement
    participant Rotor as Rotor Object

    Note over User: 1. Define Material
    User->>Mat: steel = Material(rho=7810, E=211e9...)
    activate Mat
    Mat-->>User: Returns steel object
    deactivate Mat

    Note over User: 2. Create Elements Loop
    loop For N elements
        User->>Shaft: ShaftElement(L=0.05, material=steel...)
        activate Shaft
        Shaft->>Mat: Reads properties
        Shaft-->>User: Returns element instance
        deactivate Shaft
    end

    Note over User: 3. Assemble Rotor
    User->>Rotor: rotor = Rotor(shaft_elements=[...])
    activate Rotor
    Rotor->>Rotor: Sort elements by node (n)
    Rotor->>Rotor: Map Degrees of Freedom (DoF)
    Rotor-->>User: Returns Ready-to-Run Rotor
    deactivate Rotor
